      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I experience this issue, using a Quest 2 with Index controllers and vrchat crashes as soon as one of the quest controllers is turned on while using index both controllers. I tried using one Index controller and one quest controller and it didn’t crash until I turned the other Index controller on. Crash happens either on launch or when calibrate is pressed\nThis did not occur before the merge with the Avatar Dynamics update.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
