  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-21T08:54:12.464Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "While enabling additional Kinect trackers in Amethyst, two of them took over the inputs of both controllers in SteamVR\n(This is actually a longtime SteamVR bug, happens randomly when spawning a non lighthouse tracker for the first time in the session, even if its role is set properly. I sent logs for this to the right people in hopes of getting the bug fixed.)\nWhen this happened, VRChat crashed. I wasn't able to reproduce the bug afterwards because the original bug in SteamVR is random. But I don't think VRChat should be crashing from this.\nWhile inconclusive, I'm making this canny post to see if other people, with controllers that can be completely turned off e.g. Vive wands, Index controllers, WMR, can try to turn their controllers off completely while in fullbody and in the steamvr dashboard, and see if they can crash the game that way.",
